#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dive deeper into quantum information, including density matrices, channels, and general measurements."
msgstr "Selami lebih dalam informasi kuantum, termasuk matriks densitas, channel, dan pengukuran umum."

