#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *General Formulation of Quantum Information,* the third course in the *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* series comprising the following courses:\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang di *Formulasi Umum Informasi Kuantum,* kursus ketiga dalam seri *Memahami Informasi dan Komputasi Kuantum* yang terdiri dari kursus-kursus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fundamentals of quantum algorithms](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"
msgstr "[Fondasi algoritma kuantum](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "General formulation of quantum information (this course)\n"
msgstr "Formulasi umum informasi kuantum (kursus ini)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Foundations of quantum error correction](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"
msgstr "[Fondasi koreksi kesalahan kuantum](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course describes the general formulation of quantum information, where quantum states are represented by *density matrices,*\n"
"changes in states are described by *channels,* and a more general class of *measurements* can be considered than those discussed in\n"
"*Basics of quantum information.* The course also discusses mathematical ways of formalizing the *distance* or *similarity* between\n"
"quantum states, and how they relate to channels and measurements in operational ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini mendeskripsikan formulasi umum informasi kuantum, di mana status kuantum direpresentasikan oleh *matriks densitas,*\n"
"perubahan status dideskripsikan oleh *channel,* dan kelas *pengukuran* yang lebih umum bisa dipertimbangkan dibandingkan yang dibahas dalam\n"
"*Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum.* Kursus ini juga membahas cara matematis untuk memformalkan *jarak* atau *kemiripan* antara\n"
"status kuantum, dan bagaimana mereka terhubung dengan channel dan pengukuran dengan cara operasional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, engineering, and\n"
"mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk mahasiswa, profesional, dan penghobi di bidang seperti ilmu komputer, fisika, teknik, dan\n"
"matematika yang ingin mendapatkan pengetahuan tentang fondasi teoritis informasi dan komputasi kuantum.\n"

